### Test Scenario 7: Duplicate Submission

Attempt to submit the same transaction twice.

Expected result:

- Only one transaction is recorded.
- Only one set of financial movements is created.
- Wallet balances are not updated twice.

### Test Scenario 8: Transaction Correction

Edit or void an existing transaction that has already affected a wallet.

Expected result:

- Original financial movements remain traceable.
- Appropriate reversal or correction entries are recorded.
- Balances are recalculated correctly.
- Unrelated wallets remain unchanged.

